# Generated diagnostic outputs (e.g. report bundles) — but keep the committed results gallery
# and the real per-item exports. Those per_item.csv files are measured DATA, not a rendering:
# they are the trial-level artifact downstream type-2 work reads, they take minutes of real
# model inference to reproduce, and pinning them makes a result auditable against the exact rows
# it came from. The figures are regenerated from these CSVs and stay ignored.
/outputs/*
!/outputs/gallery/
!/outputs/real_contrast_type2/
!/outputs/real_degradation_type2/
!/outputs/real_distractor_type2/
report_bundle/
